{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114340","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114340","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"picture:0::1":{"text":"魔法通信機","source_cn":"魔法通讯器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x947F19C1A7611A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:0:1211434015:2":{"text":"突然、通信機からフーキンの声が聞こえてきた……","source_cn":"呼金的声音突然从通讯器中传来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C8726C4EA7C68FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211434001:0":{"text":"ついたか？その大砲がどんな形をしているのか教えてくれ。","source_cn":"你们到了？谁能给我详细描述一下那大炮的样子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DB858AF736DD8F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211434002:0":{"text":"はぁ？大砲なんてどれも同じじゃないのか？えっと、鉄板が一枚ついてて、逆側は尖ってて……","source_cn":"呃……炮不都长得差不多吗？它的上面有一块铁板，屁股是尖的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA48CF97D69A2A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211434003:0":{"text":"逆側は尖ってるんだな！？間違いない、ワシの大砲だ！","source_cn":"屁股是尖的？错不了！那是我造的炮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE840AD57A360D40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211434004:0":{"text":"正確には、ワシの設計図を盗んで作った大砲だがな！","source_cn":"准确来说，是他们偷走了我的设计图以后自己造的炮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3694AE6BDA7DACD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211434005:0":{"text":"そいつがあれば、怪物の触手を何本か吹き飛ばせるだろう。作った奴らが手抜きしてなければだがな！","source_cn":"别的我不敢保证，但它起码能轰断那怪物几根触手！前提是他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2176121189CA639F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211434006:0":{"text":"さすがにそこまでは分からねぇよ。","source_cn":"这我怎么能看得出来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4B28AD0D9384807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1211434007:0":{"text":"いいから、ここはワシの設計図を信じろ！","source_cn":"你不需要多想，我相信我的设计图！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x890B3BD31EE62A0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1211434008:0":{"text":"シンドバッド、お前さんはカテーナ号に戻ってこい。ワシらが外側、そっちはイモータル号から大砲を撃って、海獣を挟み撃ちにするんだ！","source_cn":"辛巴达，你得回到枷锁号来，我们从外围开炮，让他们从不死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A3E1CA3FDB837A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1211434009:0":{"text":"おいおい……冗談だろ？今海に飛び込んだら、海獣の胃袋まで一直線だぞ！？","source_cn":"伙计……你在开玩笑？我现在跳海等于直接跳进那怪物的胃里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E24BD0B290E66C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1211434010:0":{"text":"船を近づけて鉤縄を投げるから、縄を伝って渡ってこい！","source_cn":"我再靠近一点，射个钩锁过去，你顺着绳子荡过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x219572ABACD3DBC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1211434011:0":{"text":"無茶振りがすぎんだろ！\n……わーったよ、腹ぁくくるしかねぇ！","source_cn":"净出馊主意！\\n……行吧！大不了喂鱼呗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D1B9F07D6A92B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1211434012:1":{"text":"でもよ、大砲の中にも、周りにも砲弾が見当たらねぇ。空の大砲で何を撃てっていうんだ？","source_cn":"可是这炮没上膛，我们也没看到炮弹，两门空炮能炸出什么火花？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD808A3174CC455FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1211434013:0":{"text":"ワシの大砲は特殊な砲弾を使うんだ。<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様、ソニアさんと近くを探してみてくれ、きっとどこかに隠してあるはずだ！","source_cn":"我的炮需要填充特殊弹药，<style=stress><...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC082033139378777","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ワシの大砲は特殊な砲弾を使うんだ。<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様、ソニアさんと近くを探してみてくれ、きっとどこかに隠してあるはずだ！","female":"ワシの大砲は特殊な砲弾を使うんだ。<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様、ソニアさんと近くを探してみてくれ、きっとどこかに隠してあるはずだ！","variant_male_record_index":"1